        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri gaafa Refidimu kae gaara Horiti godaane, fullaani worri jiddu ququbate tana: lafa aloo ta Sinaiti, Kibroth-Hataava (yokhaani awaala sabdooma), Haserothi, Rethma, Remon-Peresi, Libna, Risa, Keheletha, gaara Sheferi, Harada, Makelothi, Tahathi, Tera, Mithka, Hasmora, Moserothi, Bene-Yakani, Hor-Hagigadi, Hotbatha, Abrona, Esion-Geberi, lafa aloo ta Sini (yokhaani Kadeshi) ammalle gaara Hori ka afaani lafa Edomu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.15+NUM.33.16+NUM.33.17+NUM.33.18+NUM.33.19+NUM.33.20+NUM.33.21+NUM.33.22+NUM.33.23+NUM.33.24+NUM.33.25+NUM.33.26+NUM.33.27+NUM.33.28+NUM.33.29+NUM.33.30+NUM.33.31+NUM.33.32+NUM.33.33+NUM.33.34+NUM.33.35+NUM.33.36+NUM.33.37",
